[en.IDEA_ALL_C01_COLONY]
Imperial Order

[en.IDEA_ALL_C01_COLONY_desc]
As a member of the Equestria Imperial Order, it is necessary for this country to contribute to the security and prosperity of the Empire like other members of the Empire.

[zh.IDEA_ALL_C01_COLONY]
帝国秩序

[zh.IDEA_ALL_C01_COLONY_desc]
作为小马利亚帝国秩序的成员，这个国家有必要像其他帝国成员一样，为帝国的安全和繁荣做出贡献。
